607 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Betika is an online gambling website operating mainly in Kenya and the Eastern African continent owned by Shop and Deliver Limited\054 a company based in Nairobi and having Kenyan shareholders\056 The product was losing the grip on the market due to several problems related to user experience\056 Mostly related to bad design decisions which led the development to a not enjoyable and expensive to use the product\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 608 0 R
     /Pg 585 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

