611 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The product is targeting emerging markets in Africa\054 including Kenya\054  Mozambique\054 Zambia\054 DRC and Tanzania\056 The biggest problem in this scenario is the cost of mobile data\056 For instance\054 in Mozambique 1GB of mobile data can easily cost \04415\05682 \050Ksh 1\054605\05657\051\056\nFrom here the necessity to have a web product\054 solid\054 reliable and enjoyable for those who cannot afford to pay such amount of money to surf on the internet\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 612 0 R
     /Pg 585 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

