615 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The solution applied involves changes in both design and development strategies\056 The outcome of the research highlighted how customers are sensitive to data cost\054 but also how important is for them to have also a fully\055fledged betting solution\056\nDesign\055wise\054 thanks to the Design Sprint workshop\054 the team highlighted the most impacting features for our main issue and then validated solutions\056\nFor the home page\054 the biggest change has been\072 moving from the full list of all possible sports to one single sport\054 adding the infinite scroll functionality\054 to give the customers the feeling that they are not missing any match\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 616 0 R
     /Pg 585 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
